 "default", "desc": "Bug 2075976 - Only accept one RespondWith per fetch event op in the parent process.  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333191\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338320\n", "files": ["dom/serviceworkers/FetchEventOpChild.cpp", "dom/serviceworkers/FetchEventOpProxyParent.cpp", "dom/serviceworkers/FetchEventOpProxyParent.h"], "git_node": "d037de6afa83232b85a9c9d1ab3cc796039b4170", "git_parents": ["04ef6e4ce13bdc1a13e57dbedc04130d853641e9"], "node": "ddf3f5055a2ba7112b88e733c7d9c650f358883a", "parents": ["ac940c1e4b46e95f1492c52613eb1ab94f4607c6"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793390294, "git_changesets": ["d037de6afa83232b85a9c9d1ab3cc796039b4170"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1795": {"changesets": [{"author": "Eden Chuang \u003cechuang@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074179 - Reject ErrorResult-internal nsresult values in IPC deserialization.  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D330160\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338306\n", "files": ["dom/bindings/BindingUtils.cpp", "dom/bindings/ErrorResult.h", "ipc/chromium/src/chrome/common/ipc_message_utils.h"], "git_node": "9f8dc5fbe24c7d1fbc0c277f889d70a2ef182405", "git_parents": ["d037de6afa83232b85a9c9d1ab3cc796039b4170"], "node": "f34a93e83e7140bc117aedeb37855ff21f97a169", "parents": ["ddf3f5055a2ba7112b88e733c7d9c650f358883a"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793390326, "git_changesets": ["9f8dc5fbe24c7d1fbc0c277f889d70a2ef182405"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1796": {"changesets": [{"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081980.  a=dmeehan\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337511\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338286\n", "files": ["layout/style/CSSImportRule.cpp", "layout/style/Rule.h", "layout/style/StyleSheet.h"], "git_node": "c40377927483f7a46ae170971bec0fe220c50bd1", "git_parents": ["9f8dc5fbe24c7d1fbc0c277f889d70a2ef182405"], "node": "f5b3cebd276df58966fb2af0cb219dd1c44a760a", "parents": ["f34a93e83e7140bc117aedeb37855ff21f97a169"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793390658, "git_changesets": ["c40377927483f7a46ae170971bec0fe220c50bd1"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1797": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jon Coppeard \u003cjcoppeard@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079689 - Ensure WeakRef targets are added to the CC graph  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nWe already clear WeakRef targets for GC things that are white in the CC graph,\nbut not all GC things are represented in the CC graph and if the node is\nmissing then this check will fail. There are several reasons for GC things to\nbe missing: they might be garbage or they just might not have been considered\nby the CC.\n\nThe patch ensures WeakRef targets are present in the CC graph at the start so\nwe can get an accurate result. Only objects are added. Symbols must be used as\nWeakMap keys to be part of a gray cycle and these keys are already added to the\nCC graph.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337944\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338813\n", "files": ["js/public/friend/CycleCollector.h", "js/src/gc/FinalizationObservers.cpp", "js/src/gc/FinalizationObservers.h", "js/src/gc/GCRuntime.h", "xpcom/base/CycleCollectedJSRuntime.cpp"], "git_node": "3e862c8b4e43f863047d53ceddf811596074f2cd", "git_parents": ["c40377927483f7a46ae170971bec0fe220c50bd1"], "node": "cfbe820b7fbd1ee2fb042d20cf8d739fc63ad7ae", "parents": ["f5b3cebd276df58966fb2af0cb219dd1c44a760a"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793642863, "git_changesets": ["3e862c8b4e43f863047d53ceddf811596074f2cd"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1798": {"changesets": [{"author": "Edgar Chen \u003cechen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2086767 - Save the directory instead of the file as the last temporary add-on location in about:debugging;  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338013\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338728\n", "files": ["devtools/client/aboutdebugging/src/modules/extensions-helper.js", "devtools/client/aboutdebugging/test/browser/browser_aboutdebugging_addons_temporary_install_path.js"], "git_node": "d24c6dde889c83d8ac6ba74ab51b706f1eb6b31a", "git_parents": ["3e862c8b4e43f863047d53ceddf811596074f2cd"], "node": "29ca4c8d616befea330e8bc7802826b9b7e7f748", "parents": ["cfbe820b7fbd1ee2fb042d20cf8d739fc63ad7ae"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793642883, "git_changesets": ["d24c6dde889c83d8ac6ba74ab51b706f1eb6b31a"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1799": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr115 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings tld-suffixes  a=dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338652\n", "files": ["netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/onecrl.json"], "git_node": "2f6431754ff653c31f02aac947c5a67607f6b014", "git_parents": ["d24c6dde889c83d8ac6ba74ab51b706f1eb6b31a"], "node": "5efe78aa2b9fe6847f82dc02fc38de03bc36fc89", "parents": ["29ca4c8d616befea330e8bc7802826b9b7e7f748"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793643113, "git_changesets": ["2f6431754ff653c31f02aac947c5a67607f6b014"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1800": {"changesets": [{"author": "DonalMe \u003c76789979+DonalMe@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079689 - Fix ESR115 build a=bustage\n", "files": ["js/src/gc/FinalizationObservers.cpp", "xpcom/base/CycleCollectedJSRuntime.cpp"], "git_node": "e2dcd01d5f8d0c41533477435d76d6f2fc57fbfd", "git_parents": ["2f6431754ff653c31f02aac947c5a67607f6b014"], "node": "c3438f03dd12dd9d387647940b459a0b3d629816", "parents": ["5efe78aa2b9fe6847f82dc02fc38de03bc36fc89"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793645240, "git_changesets": ["e2dcd01d5f8d0c41533477435d76d6f2fc57fbfd"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1801": {"changesets": [{"author": "John M. Schanck \u003cjschanck@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2088180 - upgrade NSS to NSS_3_90_7_RTM.  UPGRADE_NSS_RELEASE  a=dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338874\n", "files": ["security/certverifier/ExtendedValidation.cpp", "security/nss/TAG-INFO", "security/nss/lib/ckfw/builtins/certdata.txt", "security/nss/lib/ckfw/builtins/nssckbi.h", "security/nss/lib/ckfw/builtins/nssckbi.rc", "security/nss/lib/nss/nss.h", "security/nss/lib/softoken/softkver.h", "security/nss/lib/util/nssutil.h"], "git_node": "01e26f22f93db4a80f715676f906f40a7888b67d", "git_parents": ["e2dcd01d5f8d0c41533477435d76d6f2fc57fbfd"], "node": "36964c963381a30e422fe89eb9e5852ca4e779a2", "parents": ["c3438f03dd12dd9d387647940b459a0b3d629816"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793654573, "git_changesets": ["01e26f22f93db4a80f715676f906f40a7888b67d"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1802": {"changesets": [{"author": "Randell Jesup \u003crjesup@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2083626:  gate the optimized jar layout behind an explicit opt-in  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nBuildFileList's offset-4 \"optimized jar layout\" shortcut (bug 559961) was\ngated only on XRE_IsParentProcess(), not on whether the file is actually\nour own omni.jar.\n\nAdd aAllowOptimizedLayout to nsZipArchive::OpenArchive, defaulting to\nfalse, and have Omnijar pass true, since it already knows the file is our\nown omni.jar. Every other caller now always uses the standard EOCD-based\nparse.\n\nAlso updates test_corrupt_1801102.js: its fixture happens to have a\nCentral Directory signature at offset 4, so it's now rejected at open()\ninstead of later during test().\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335617\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338775\n", "files": ["modules/libjar/nsZipArchive.cpp", "modules/libjar/nsZipArchive.h", "modules/libjar/test/unit/test_corrupt_1801102.js", "xpcom/build/Omnijar.cpp"], "git_node": "4a1ebd35817fbc0f29cd1b8a0d6743c5f5d1a69f", "git_parents": ["01e26f22f93db4a80f715676f906f40a7888b67d"], "node": "a35813e34ddea466e5871e1acc0c9f6551a57b5b", "parents": ["36964c963381a30e422fe89eb9e5852ca4e779a2"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793721950, "git_changesets": ["4a1ebd35817fbc0f29cd1b8a0d6743c5f5d1a69f"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1803": {"changesets": [{"author": "Harveer Singh \u003chsingh@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082109 - Hold a strong reference to SessionStorageManager in Observe.  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338121\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D339082\n", "files": ["dom/storage/SessionStorageManager.cpp"], "git_node": "4be754621167610a175492d8e3fa54b5d2a5689b", "git_parents": ["4a1ebd35817fbc0f29cd1b8a0d6743c5f5d1a69f"], "node": "746d5459819c2bb25aed30a939988181faaeceb8", "parents": ["a35813e34ddea466e5871e1acc0c9f6551a57b5b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793721971, "git_changesets": ["4be754621167610a175492d8e3fa54b5d2a5689b"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1804": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jonathan Kew \u003cjkew@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082451 - Add guarded-by annotation to mPlatformFontEntry.  a=dmeehan\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338812\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D339073\n", "files": ["gfx/thebes/gfxFontEntry.cpp", "gfx/thebes/gfxTextRun.cpp", "gfx/thebes/gfxUserFontSet.cpp", "gfx/thebes/gfxUserFontSet.h", "layout/style/FontFaceSetDocumentImpl.cpp"], "git_node": "66a4d5ccaef69b9ef509b9e6b457f4756f2ee366", "git_parents": ["4be754621167610a175492d8e3fa54b5d2a5689b"], "node": "07da6c6c016add6f8270a4ac0e53320df73b1b1c", "parents": ["746d5459819c2bb25aed30a939988181faaeceb8"], "tags": ["FIREFOX_115_45_0esr_BUILD1", "FIREFOX_115_45_0esr_RELEASE"]}], "date": 1793722127, "git_changesets": ["66a4d5ccaef69b9ef509b9e6b457f4756f2ee366"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}}
